|-----|------|---------|-----------|----------|
| #11 | `WjWorldStatsSubsystem.cpp` | 229-262 | Invalid FUniqueNetIdRepl reconstruction when OSS/IdentityInterface unavailable | High |
| #11 | `PlayerProfileWidget.cpp` | 129-145 | UserId comparison fails if broadcast UserId is invalid | High |
